            <p>I'm a technologist, researcher, and educator specializing in digital humanities and Caribbean cultural studies from a literary framing. I have experience working in higher education institutions, professional organizations, and journals. I enjoy helping small teams manage, maintain, and build digital projects. My work combines project management, critical digital pedagogy, and web development.</p>
